WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.308
This restricted account

00:00:01.308 --> 00:00:02.536
reached system masters.

00:00:02.536 --> 00:00:03.763
Here's the move.

00:00:03.913 --> 00:00:05.589
Rewind. A local AI agent

00:00:05.589 --> 00:00:06.930
maps fifty-two access rules.

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:09.038
It follows a continuity token.

00:00:09.038 --> 00:00:09.822
Then finds

00:00:09.822 --> 00:00:10.997
the impersonate permission.

00:00:11.147 --> 00:00:12.377
Not a new pod.

00:00:12.377 --> 00:00:13.300
An impersonation header,

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:14.530
on one read request.

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:16.233
System masters. Secret accessed.

00:00:16.233 --> 00:00:17.398
The privilege ends

00:00:17.398 --> 00:00:18.563
with the request.

00:00:18.713 --> 00:00:19.763
No persistent objects.

00:00:19.763 --> 00:00:20.463
Not invisible.

00:00:20.463 --> 00:00:22.563
Audit logs can still record it.

00:00:22.713 --> 00:00:23.819
Scanners list findings.

00:00:23.819 --> 00:00:26.030
Offens AI proves the working path.
